    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Geraghty offer to the market, this 4 bedroom semi-detached property nestled within the popular and well established Woodlands Estate. This attractive residence enjoys an enviable cul-de-sac location with plenty of green space throughout the estate, offering spacious and versatile family accommodation in a highly convenient location in the heart of Ratoath, Co. Meath.The accommodation comprises bright and well proportioned living spaces, 3 reception rooms, along with four well appointed bedrooms, making it an ideal home for a growing family. Further features include a convenient side entrance a low maintenance rear garden with the added benefit of a bar, creating a fantastic space for entertaining and relaxing.This location is particularly appealing for families, with lots of open spaces, walking distance to local schools, shops, cafes, bars and restaurants. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this wonderful home has to offer.For transparency purposes, bidding is on line via the \"mysherryfitz\" bidding platform."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \n- Canadian Maple solid wood flooring throughout, wallpapered hallway, radiator cover, spotlights\n\nSitting Room - \n- Candian maple solid wood floor , sandstone fireplace with gas insert, painted walls, large windows to front allowing natural light, wooden shutters for privacy\n\nWC - \n- Tiled flooring, painted walls and a window for natural light and ventilation, wc, whb.\n\nKitchen - \n- To the rear of the residence with tiled floors, built in appliances, cream wooden wall & floor cabinets, spotlights, skylight for natural light\n\nUtility Room - \n- Just off the kitchen, room to the washing machine, dryer and boiler, with window for light and ventilation\n\nStudy/TV room - \n- Solid maple floor, wallpaper walls , double doors to dining room\n\nDining Room - \n- Double doors to rear, skylight, wallpapered walls, door leading into kitchen and additional double doors to study/TV room\n\nUpstairs - \nWooden Bannister & handrail, carpet on stairs, wallpapered walls, window for light on landing\n\nFront Bedroom 1 - \n- Double room to front of the residence with carpet underfoot, painted walls and built in wardrobe, shutters on windows\n\nFront Bedroom 2 - \n- Large double bedroom with wall to wall built in wardrobe, carpet underfoot and painted walls, shutters on windows\n\nEn-Suite - \n- Fully tiled floor, shower area and splashback ,PVC panel on walls, pump shower\n\nRear Bedroom 3 - \n- Double Room to the rear of the residence, carpet underfoot, built in wardrobe and painted walls, shutters on windows\n\nRear Bedroom 4 - \n- Single room to the rear of the residence with semi solid flooring, painted walls, shutters on windows\n\nMain Bathroom - \n- 3 piece suite, fully tiled with Triton electric shower over bath and window for light and ventilation, shutters n windows\n\nAttic - \naccess via landing\n\nOutside - \n- Extra wide driveway entranceWalled front garden Cobble lock to front and rear Painted fence panels Bar to rearArtificial grass to rearElectric sockets\n\nIncluded in Sale - \nCurtains, Window shutters, fixtures and fittings, bar, bar fridges\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Under Stairs Storage</li><li>Gas Fired Central Heating</li><li>Extra wide driveway entrance </li><li>Low maintenance rear garden</li><li>Extensions to the rear</li><li>Walking distance to village and all amenities</li><li>External electrical sockets</ul>"
      },
